<title>ITALY: IMI to raise stake in San Paolo.</title>
<headline>IMI to raise stake in San Paolo.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMI SpA said on Tuesday it would boost its stake in Istituto Bancario San Paolo di Torino to five percent from two percent.</p>
<p>&quot;IMI will exercise its option to raise its stake in San Paolo to five percent,&quot; chairman Luigi Arcuti told reporters after a steering committee meeting.</p>
</text>
